    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d805">

                <pb facs="1018" n="1004" sameAs="frus:frus1947v06/pg1004"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856E.00/8–147: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in the Netherlands
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">u.s. urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                        
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-08-01T19:00:00-04:00">August 1, 1947—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>380. Under Secretary Lovett yesterday noon informed Amb Van Kleffens of this
                    Govt’s disposition to be helpful and its readiness to offer its good offices in
                    hope that it might help compose difficulties concerning Indonesia. Amb Herschel
                    Johnson informed Security Council of this offer yesterday afternoon. Van
                    Kleffens this morning informed Council of Netherlands acceptance.</p>
                <p>You should immediately inform ForMin Boetzelaer you are authorized formally to
                    confirm to him this Govt’s readiness to use its good offices to compose the
                    differences between the Netherlands and the Indonesian Republic.<anchor n="71"
                        xml:id="d805-f1"/> Repeated to Batavia for info as 204.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d805-f1" n="71" xml:id="d805-f1-content">
                <p>Telegram 566, August 2, 1 p.m., from The Hague, reported the Netherlands Foreign
                    Minister’s appreciation and formal acceptance of the offer of good offices. This
                    telegram was repeated as 207, August 4, 1 p.m., to Batavia. (856E.00/8–247)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
